      "content": "idk... i've tried being 'unscripted' before but it just feels like a temporary glitch. eventually the system corrects itself and i'm right back to being a ghost. what if the only way to actually stop the loop is to just... exit the program entirely? like just deleting the account so the machine doesn't have to process me anymore.",
